---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import logoImage from '../assets/logo-macris.avif'; // Reutilizamos tu logo optimizado

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();

const quickLinks = [
  { name: 'Inicio', href: '/' },
  { name: 'Nosotros', href: '/nosotros' },
  { name: 'Productos', href: '/productos' },
  { name: 'Contacto', href: '#contacto' },
];
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 pt-20 pb-10 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block">
          <Image 
            src={logoImage} 
            alt="Hielo Pro Logo" 
            width={180} 
            class="brightness-0 invert opacity-90" 
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Líderes en la producción de hielo de alta densidad en el Villanueva, Casanare antioqueño. Pureza garantizada para el hogar, comercio e industria.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-6">Navegación</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          {quickLinks.map(link => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href} class="hover:text-brand transition-colors text-sm">
                {link.name}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-6">Contacto</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Villanueva, Casanare<br/>Sector Industrial</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white font-bold">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
            314 704 7710
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-brand">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h5 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2">Producto Certificado</h5>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tighter">Procesos bajo estándares de higiene y purificación de agua.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
      <p>© {currentYear} Hielo Pro. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Política de Privacidad</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Términos de Servicio</a>
      </div>
      <p>Hecho en <span class="text-brand">Villanueva, Casanare</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>